&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Computer Science or equivalent experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of software development experience, with at least 5 years of experience designing and building enterprise grade software&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years managing engineering teams, balancing new feature/product development and maintaining existing features.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
