&lt;p&gt;At Okta, we celebrate a variety of perspectives and experiences. We are not looking for someone who checks every single box - we’re looking for lifelong learners and people who can make us better with their unique experiences.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join our team! We’re building a world where Identity belongs to you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Authentication Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Okta supports a wide variety of organizations across both the Workforce and Consumer spaces. These diverse environments present unique challenges; no two organizations have the same requirements when it comes to the desired authentication experience for their end users. We are dedicated to striking the perfect balance between robust security and effortless usability. We are constantly building cutting-edge authentication mechanisms designed to make access seamless, specifically tailored for the fast-paced, user-centric world of consumer identity and security-centric world of workforce identity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you are driven to innovate, passionate about the intersection of product flexibility and security, and want to help shape how the world connects to technology—we’d love for you to join us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Duties and Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with cross-functional teams (Architects, QA, Product, Documentation, and UX teams) to ideate, design and implement features that drive the core authentication experience for users in the Workforce and Customer identity landscape&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Propose and align on technical strategy and tactical/long term roadmap&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Produce technical designs, proposals, and architectural decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop high-quality, maintainable software components with comprehensive unit/functional tests&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in code reviews, providing feedback and ensuring adherence to coding standards and security best practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to technical documentation and knowledge sharing within the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor and coach junior engineers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;12+ years of strong hands-on experience designing &amp;amp;&amp;nbsp; developing enterprise software using &lt;strong&gt;Java with Springboot&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep proficiency in object-oriented programming principles, design patterns, server-side technologies, distributed system concepts(caching, asynchronous processing, multi-threading) and performance optimization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert understanding of secure coding practices, &lt;strong&gt;authentication/authorization protocols &lt;/strong&gt;(FIDO2/WebAuthn, SSO, OAuth, OIDC, SAML etc.), and identity management concepts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing and building scalable, distributed systems and RESTful APIs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Skilled in debugging and troubleshooting complex java codebase&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passionate about writing clean, maintainable and scalable code with a deep focus on security&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid experience with &lt;strong&gt;cloud infrastructure platforms&lt;/strong&gt; particularly AWS and GCP and databases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience with Agile methodologies (Scrum/Kanban), CI/CD pipelines, and automation tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and interpersonal skills and proven ability to work with cross-functional(Product/Design/QA) and geo-distributed teams&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and mentor junior engineers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with phishing-resistant authentications such as Passkeys, Smart Card or Okta FastPass&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Some experience with basic UI development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education and Training:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Computer Science or equivalent experience&lt;/li&gt;
