&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1391&quot; data-local-id=&quot;252d5e2cd208&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Mentor&lt;/strong&gt; engineers, &lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;raising the bar&lt;/strong&gt; on technical craftsmanship and solution &lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;quality&lt;/strong&gt; across the full stack.&lt;/li&gt;
