&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design and Develop Scalable Platforms:&lt;/strong&gt; Build and maintain scalable data platforms using AWS, Snowflake, dbt, and Databricks.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
