&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Infrastructure as Code:&lt;/strong&gt; Utilize Terraform to manage infrastructure as code, ensuring consistent and reproducible environments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
