&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CI/CD Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Develop and maintain CI/CD pipelines for data platform applications using GitHub and GitLab.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI/ML Infrastructure:&lt;/strong&gt; Engineer robust data pipelines that fuel high-performance AI and ML models by delivering reliable, feature-rich datasets.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Governance &amp;amp; Strategy:&lt;/strong&gt; Implement comprehensive data governance frameworks to ensure data lineage, compliance, and quality across all analytical platforms.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
