&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Security &amp;amp; Compliance:&lt;/strong&gt; Conduct vulnerability scans, apply necessary patches, and ensure data security meets industry standards.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
