&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;BS in Computer Science, Computer Engineering&lt;/strong&gt;, or equivalent technical experience that enables you to rationalize and influence complex architectural decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proven ability to produce solid, actionable plans&lt;/strong&gt; from incomplete, conflicting, or highly ambiguous inputs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Exceptional communication and presentation skills&lt;/strong&gt;, with a track record of successfully collaborating across global functions and time zones.&lt;/li&gt;
