&lt;p&gt;Okta is The World’s Identity Company. We free everyone to safely use any technology, anywhere, on any device or app. Our flexible and neutral products, Okta Platform and Auth0 Platform, provide secure access, authentication, and automation, placing identity at the core of business security and growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Okta, we celebrate a variety of perspectives and experiences. We are not looking for someone who checks every single box - we’re looking for lifelong learners and people who can make us better with their unique experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join our team! We’re building a world where Identity belongs to you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Core Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Product Marketing Manager for Global System Integrators (GSI) and Channel Partners, you will drive go-to-market efforts that align Okta’s identity platform with the business strategies and solutions of key AMER and global partners. You’ll be responsible for creating scalable sales plays, positioning frameworks, and enablement assets tailored to joint value propositions across multiple verticals and geographies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role demands a strategic, collaborative, and execution-oriented marketer who thrives on working cross-functionally with Sales, Product, Partner, and Regional Marketing teams to accelerate pipeline, partner-sourced revenue, and global awareness.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Go-to-Market Execution&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support cross-functional product launches and solution rollouts in collaboration with GSI and Channel partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support integrated campaigns to drive GSI and Channel pipeline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the development of partner-specific value props, solution overviews, pitch decks, playbooks and strategic partner program updates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Enablement to plan and execute enablement materials, to be delivered both internally and externally (with partners).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Content Creation &amp;amp; Cross-functional Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In collaboration with partner marketing, partner programs and external agencies, author partner-branded content such as solution briefs, customer case studies, and blog posts to support demand gen and awareness.&lt;/li&gt;
