&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Strong understanding of CI/CD pipelines, deployment strategies, and automation-first operational practices.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Proven ability to balance reliability, scalability, security, and engineering velocity.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
