&lt;p&gt;This is a team working at the edge of what identity means in a world of AI agents. You&#39;ll have real ownership of hard, unsolved problems, backed by Okta&#39;s platform, Auth0&#39;s developer relationships, and a team that values technical depth and customer impact in equal measure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll help shape the product, not just implement a backlog. You&#39;ll work with people who care about getting the details right. And you&#39;ll be building something that matters to the developers and organizations trying to do AI responsibly.&lt;/p&gt;
