&lt;li&gt;A track record of leading or managing high performing platform teams (3 year experience minimum)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with end to end project delivery; building roadmaps through operational sustainability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong facilitation skills (design, requirements gathering, progress and status sessions)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Production experience with distributed systems running in AWS. GCP a bonus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion about automation and leveraging agile software development methodologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in developing Continuous Delivery pipelines for a diverse set of projects using Java, Jenkins, AWS, Docker, Python, Ruby, Bash, and more&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in building internal developer tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
