&lt;p&gt;Global Innovation Center SE team (Presales):&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Over the last 3 years, Okta in Bangalore has fueled our growth around the world. The Global Innovation Center Presales team has been a crucial part of this growth. We are expanding this team made up of exceptional high-performing individuals. In this team, you will focus on being a customer-facing solution engineer crafting identity and security solutions for commercial segments in the US, ranging from digitally native start-ups to scaling SMBs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;As a Solutions Engineer you will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support our customers along their sales journey by showing them the value of the Okta technology through live demonstrations and sales presentations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sell directly to IT managers, developers, product managers, and occasionally more senior executives across various industries..&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have a focus on our &lt;em&gt;Okta Workforce Identity&lt;/em&gt; solutions and be able to model how this solution will support their current architecture requirements and use cases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute well-defined, outcome-focused POCs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain a broad and deep technical understanding of the Okta product line and the underlying technologies and protocols&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Occasionally participate in local and regional events evangelising Okta as a presenter and an attendee.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We are looking for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ability to work in the EST Time Zone&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A minimum of 5 years of working experience in IAM or a related SaaS field as a pre-sales engineer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise or hands-on experience in IAM, single sign-on, multi-factor authentication, passwordless authentication, universal directory, privileged access, and device access is preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with REST APIs and SDKs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to communicate complex ideas and solutions, incorporating white-boarding, practical examples, and product demonstrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in a customer-facing role such as consulting, customer support, or pre-sales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong empathy, listening skills and time management skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
