&lt;li&gt;A track record of designing and shipping APIs or developer-facing surfaces at scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort owning ambiguous problems without heavy top-down scoping&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on familiarity with agentic tooling, MCP, or LLM-facing API design - a meaningful differentiator for this role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience collaborating across engineering, product, and architecture in a fast-moving environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A bias for execution - you ship, you learn fast, and you make the people around you better&lt;/li&gt;
