&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with cloud providers (AWS, Azure) and container technologies such as Kubernetes, Docker&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with or interest in the Identity and Access Management (IAM) business domain&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
